    {
      "id": "claim_2691601690d04961b240edb36a8ae7fc",
      "statement": "In the audio player (player.js), the volume is set to 1.0 on every session start and is not stored in localStorage; ArrowUp/ArrowDown adjust it by 0.1 clamped to [0,1] with one-decimal precision via PlayerCore.clamp, and Space toggles play/pause, all guarded by isEditableTarget.",
