      "id": "claim_874259a8daee40de82a3feda36cca2ff",
      "statement": "The PlayerCore module (player-core.js) is the single try/catch-guarded localStorage access layer, providing readSetting/readBoolSetting/writeSetting/writeBoolSetting (plus readJSON/writeJSON/removeSetting) with type-safe boolean handling; storage failures are logged via logStorageError without interrupting the UI.",
